1. What you need to set up (Google side)

To use Google login + read emails, you’ll work with:

Google OAuth 2.0
Gmail API
✅ Steps to configure (important)
1. Go to Google Cloud Console
Google Cloud Console
Create a new project
2. Enable APIs

Enable:

Gmail API
3. Create OAuth Credentials
Go to → “Credentials”
Create → OAuth Client ID

Choose:

Web Application

Add:

Authorized redirect URI
Example:
http://localhost:3002/auth/google/callback

👉 You will get:

Client ID
Client Secret
4. Scopes (VERY IMPORTANT)

You need these scopes:

openid
email
profile
https://www.googleapis.com/auth/gmail.readonly

👉 This allows:

Login
Read emails